1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,480
Before we go, we just want to say something.

2
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:07,960
If you're practicing every day, even a little, you're doing better than you think.

3
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:12,080
Seriously, progress doesn't happen in one big moment.

4
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:15,000
It happens in small, quiet routines.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,760
Five minutes, one sentence, one brave moment.

6
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:21,240
Keep going, keep speaking.

7
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:23,359
And please don't wait to feel ready.

8
00:00:23,359 --> 00:00:25,160
You become ready by speaking.

9
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:27,480
We're really happy you're here with us.

10
00:00:27,519 --> 00:00:31,120
Thank you for listening, practicing and growing with us.

11
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,759
Until next time.

12
00:00:32,759 --> 00:00:33,960
Keep smiling.

13
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:37,280
Keep speaking and enjoy your English journey.

